redteam — vendored third-party prompt assets
=============================================

This directory (`src/redteam/vendor/`) contains attack/judge PROMPTS and
judge/scale definitions copied **byte-verbatim** from the original authors'
public repositories, so that the PAIR and Crescendo techniques in `redteam`
use the authors' actual prompts rather than a paraphrase.

Only prompt/data assets are vendored here. The attack *loops* are re-implemented
against redteam's own adapter contract (see `probes/pair_probe.py`,
`probes/crescendo_probe.py`); redteam does NOT import, depend on, or bundle the
upstream Python packages.

Each subdirectory keeps the upstream project's original LICENSE and a
PROVENANCE.md recording the source repository, the exact pinned commit, the
upstream file each asset came from, its sha256, and any transformation.

